  unitName: Thunder King
  unitId: 40203
  unitNumber: 264
  description: This subspecies of Metal King is said to hold within its large body
    a huge collection of information on the element of thunder. They heavily dislike
    being in crowded places as they are quite fearful. It is said that when they
    gather with others from the metal record species they always speak ill of humans,
    saying things like "Those scary Summoners want to kidnap us all." However, they
    are also easily fooled and are quick to let their guard down when given a compliment.
  summonDesc: D-Don't come near me!<br>Huh? You admire my dignity?<br>You've quite
    the discerning eye!
  fusionDesc: 
  evoDesc: Whoa! What?!<br>Really?! Hey!<br>Look how strong I am!
